OL,3,GNEWSASmoke warning over scrap metal and
OL,4,Aelectrical fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large smoke plume has spread across
OL,7,Fparts of east Dorset after a fire broke
OL,8,Fout at a recycling centre overnight.
OL,10,FFirefighters were called to the site at
OL,11,FCandys Lane in Corfe Mullen, near the
OL,12,FA31, shortly after 02:30 BST.
OL,14,FTen fire engines, along with water
OL,15,Fcarriers, are at the scene of the blaze
OL,16,Finvolving scrap metal and electrical
OL,17,Fitems, with crews working hard to bring
OL,18,Fit under control, Dorset and Wiltshire
OL,19,FFire and Rescue said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
